devnodes(1m)     devnodes - re-create missing device nodes at boot
display(4)       display - which screen X uses on this machine, and how it starts
display.d(4)     display.d - the display cards X can use, one file each
dlpi-mac(1m)     dlpi-mac - print the station address of a network interface
ifdown(1m)       ifup, ifdown - bring network interfaces up or down
ifup(1m)         ifup, ifdown - bring network interfaces up or down
inittab(4)       inittab - what init starts, at boot and at each run level
interfaces(4)    interfaces - how each network interface is set up at boot
link.d(4)        link.d - the network drivers present, one file each
man(1)           man - display a manual page, from the add-on packages or from the stock system
network-config(4) network-config, rc.inet - network commands run at every boot
nodename(4)      nodename - the machine's name
profile(4)       profile - the login shell's start-up commands for every user
profile.d(4)     profile.d - the packages' additions to the login environment
rc.conf(4)       rc.conf - which boot services run, and their settings
rc.inet(4)       network-config, rc.inet - network commands run at every boot
rc.subr(1m)      rc.subr - shell functions for the boot scripts of the add-on packages
xstart(1)        xstart - start X on this machine's display
